# Development ledger

## 2026-11-10 - Windows v0.2.2 release follow-through

- The new request authorizes reviewed source publication, a matching release
  tag and a side-by-side local package installation. It does not authorize
  driving or restarting an independently running GUI or starting live actions.
- The existing source launcher directly invokes the checkout and configured
  workspace; it does not fetch a hosted EXE. Preserve that command and setup.
- Selected unused patch version v0.2.2 after verifying owner/repository access,
  remote main and both earlier releases. Align package metadata, concise README,
  tutorial, affected guides and bundled first-run instructions.
- The initial tracking preview rejected a placeholder backlink without remote
  writes. Removed the placeholder; use only the actual synchronizer-created URL.
- Qualification, reviewed commit/tag, hosted publication and downloaded local
  installation remain distinct pending gates. Existing media need no recapture.
- The first full source gate passed Ruff, Black and mypy, then found two
  order-dependent theme-reopen failures (770 tests passed). The Qt-free import
  test had reloaded shared palette classes. Run that import in a fresh process
  to preserve the stronger real reopen assertions and avoid suite pollution.
- Corrected full release gates pass Ruff, Black (117 files), mypy (72 source
  files) and 772 tests with native exit zero. Source version and the unchanged
  source launcher help check pass without starting a GUI or automation.
  The new release issue is #22 with its actual durable backlink and one
  In Progress item; publication and installed-asset checks remain pending.
- Published the reviewed 56-file commit
  d06cf742fa7ce6b63267cf5efb5033504a713db8 and matching annotated v0.2.2
  tag by a normal atomic push, with verified local attribution and trailers.
  Canonical hosted-tree read-back matches every reviewed source blob.
- Exact hosted main run 42682056610 and tag run 42682056827 both completed
  successfully, including source gates, frozen build and offline executable
  checks. Only the tag run published. Updated release notes match the reviewed
  versioned text after transport-newline normalization; latest stable is v0.2.2.
- Downloaded all three actual hosted assets. Hosted digests, SHA256SUMS,
  exact manifest source/version, safe ZIP inventory and all 450 file sizes/
  hashes pass. The 114,579,088-byte ZIP is installed into a new 0.2.2
  directory without replacing an earlier installation.
- Eight installed frozen checks pass with native exit zero, including the
